AgriSmart AI
1. Introduction:
   Our project is AgriSmart AI. It helps farmers choose the best crops using Artificial Intelligence.
2. Problem:
   Farmers face problems in selecting crops, managing water, fertilizers, and budget.
3. Solution:
   Our AI system suggests suitable crops and predicts crop production.
4. How it works:
   Enter soil details.
   Enter weather details.
   Enter budget.
   AI selects the best crops.
   It predicts crop yield.
   It shows expected profit.
5. Innovation:
   Our project saves water, reduces fertilizer wastage, and supports Telugu and English.
6. Objectives:
   Increase crop production.
   Reduce wastage.
   Save water.
   Help farmers earn better profits.
7. System Architecture:
   Farmer Input → AI Model → Resource Optimization → Dashboard.
8. Technologies:
   Python, Flask, HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Machine Learning.
9. Conclusion:
   Our main aim is to help farmers make smart farming decisions and improve agriculture.
